          "completeAcceptedSourceDeclaration": "noncomputable def truncationBudget (ν : Measure ℝ) (n : ℕ) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=\n  (n : ℝ) * ∫ z : ℝ, truncationF ((1 + t) * z) ∂ν",
